<SEOPage title="Assign Shopify variant images by colour | VariantLens" description="Manually assign the correct product photos to each Shopify colour variant and display the matching gallery when shoppers change colour." eyebrow="Colour variant images" heading="Assign Shopify product images by colour" intro="Connect every colour variant with its own verified set of product photos."><h2>Give each colour a complete image set</h2><p>A useful colour gallery can include more than one featured photograph. Merchants may need front, back, side, detail, and lifestyle images for every colour option.</p><h2>Choose the images yourself</h2><p>VariantLens presents the available product media so you can assign the correct set to each variant. The process is manual by design: you decide what belongs together and can verify the storefront result.</p><h2>What shoppers see</h2><p>When the selected colour changes, the VariantLens storefront gallery displays the images assigned to that variant. Unrelated colour photography stays out of the active gallery.</p><h2>Keep assignments maintainable</h2><p>Review assignments when adding new colours or replacing product photography. A deliberate workflow keeps the gallery aligned with the catalogue as it changes.</p></SEOPage>

